                                                "sense_id": "a036421e-cede-3658-9658-d50d56d42917",
                                                "text": "The rigid could reach the greatest sizes and speeds of any airship, but was expensive to build and bulky to store. Rigids fell out of favor after the R101 and Hindenburg disasters made the type seem unsafe to the travelling public."
